{"title":"The economics of mass deportation","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/946198841/0/marginalrevolution~The-economics-of-mass-deportation.html","date":1770885477000,"content":"<blockquote><p>Following the removal of 50% of unauthorized immigrants, in the short run average native real wages rise 0.15% nationally, driven by an increase in the capital-labor ratio. In the long run, however, native real wages fall in every state, and by 0.33% nationally, as capital gets decumulated in response to a lower population. Consumer prices in the sectors intensive in unauthorized workers – such as Farming – rise by about 1% relative to the price of the average consumption basket, while most other sectors experience negligible relative price changes.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>That <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/papers/w34790\" target=\"_blank\">research result</a> is from <span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/people/javier_cravino\">Javier Cravino</a>, </span> <span> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/people/andrei_levchenko\">Andrei A. Levchenko</a>, </span> <span> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/people/francesc_ortega\">Francesc Ortega</a> </span> <span> &amp; <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/people/nitya_pandalainayar\">Nitya Pandalai-Nayar</a>.</span></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/the-economics-of-mass-deportation.html\">The economics of mass deportation</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/946198841/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/946198841/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/946198841/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/946198841/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/946198841/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/946198841/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/the-economics-of-mass-deportation.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/the-economics-of-mass-deportation.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/the-economics-of-mass-deportation.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/the-economics-of-mass-deportation.html#comment-161015942\">In reply to Sure.   paycheck of me said that $20537 from this ...</a> <i>by Eliza Granville</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/the-economics-of-mass-deportation.html#comment-161015929\">In reply to Kent Guida.   The “debacle” of 20 years of ...</a> <i>by The Original D</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/the-economics-of-mass-deportation.html#comment-161015915\">In reply to alex.   Right? I'll take that bargain every day for ...</a> <i>by Anti-Gnostic<